    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorkii Yeruusaalem oo Adonii Sedeq ahaa markuu maqlay siduu Yashuuca Aacii u qabsaday, oo uu dhammaanteed u baabbi'iyey, iyo siduu Yerixoo iyo boqorkeediiba ku sameeyey, oo uu haddana sidaas oo kale ku sameeyey Aacii iyo boqorkeediiba, iyo siday dadkii Gibecoon degganaa oo ku dhex jiray ula nabdeen reer binu Israa'iil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayuu aad u cabsaday, maxaa yeelay, Gibecoon waxay ahayd magaalo weyn sida mid ka mid ah magaalooyinka boqorrada, waayo, way ka sii weynayd Aacii, oo dadkeeda oo dhammuna waa xoog badnaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed boqorkii Yeruusaalem oo ahaa Adonii Sedeq wuxuu u cid diray boqorkii Xebroon oo ahaa Hoohaam, iyo boqorkii Yarmuud oo ahaa Firaam, iyo boqorkii Laakiish oo ahaa Yaafiica, iyo boqorkii Cegloon oo ahaa Debiir, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ii kaalaya, oo i caawiya, oo ina keena aynu Gibecoon baabbi'innee; waayo, waxay la nabadday Yashuuca iyo reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed shantii boqor oo reer Amor waa iswada urursadeen, oo kuwaasu waxay ahaayeen boqorkii Yeruusaalem, iyo boqorkii Xebroon, iyo boqorkii Yarmuud, iyo boqorkii Laakiish, iyo boqorkii Cegloon; iyaga iyo ciidammadooda oo dhammu kor bay u bixiyeen oo waxay hor degeen Gibecoon oo dagaal ku qaadeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii reer Gibecoon waxay u cid dirteen Yashuuca oo joogay xeradii Gilgaal, oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Gacantaadu yay ka raagin addoommadaada, noo soo dhaqso, oo na badbaadi, oo na caawi: maxaa yeelay, boqorradii reer Amor oo buuraha degganaa oo dhammu way isu kaayo urursadeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Yashuuca wuxuu ka tegey Gilgaal isagoo ay la socdaan dadkii dagaalyahannada ahaa oo dhan iyo raggii xoogga lahaa oo dhammuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu Yashuuca ku yidhi, Iyaga ha ka cabsan, waayo, iyaga gacmahaagaan kuu soo geliyey. Midkoodna isma kaa hor taagi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed Yashuuca ayaa ku soo kediyey iyagii, waayo, habeenkii oo dhan buu ka soo guuraynayay Gilgaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Rabbigu cabsi ku riday iyagii reer binu Israa'iil hortooda, oo Gibecoon agteeda ayuu aad ugu laayay, oo wuxuu u eryaday xagga jidkii kor loo baxo Beytxooroon, oo wuxuu ku laynayay ilaa Caseeqaah iyo tan iyo Maqeedaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay ka carareen reer binu Israa'iil, intay ku sii jireen dhaadhaca Beytxooroon, ayaa Rabbigu wuxuu iyaga samada kaga soo daayay roob dhagaxyo leh oo waaweyn ilaa Caseeqaah, oo way dhinteen; oo intii roobkii dhagaxyada lahaa ku dhimatay baa ka sii badnayd intoodii reer binu Israa'iil seefta ku laayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
