              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu Yashuuca u wada laayay dadkii dalkii oo dhan, kaas oo ahaa waddankii buuraha ahaa, iyo xaggii Koonfureed, iyo dooxooyinkii, iyo dhaadhacyadii, iyo xataa boqorradoodii oo dhan, oo waxba kama uu reebin; laakiinse wuu wada baabbi'iyey intii neefsanaysay oo dhan, sidii uu Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil ku amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
